# Never commit real question banks. See `itembank guard` and the CI job.
*_MC_Bank.md
*_Exam_Bank.md
*_Question_Bank.md
*_Quiz_Bank.md
*_mc_bank.md
*_exam_bank.md

# Generated output
# Release artifacts from build.py -- published to GitHub Releases, never committed.
dist/
_attempts/
# Learner evidence stays on disk, beside the bank, and never enters the repository.
_evidence/
# The operation journal is durable local record, never repository content.
_journal/
session_*.json
*_attempt_*.md
*_quiz.html
*_study.html

# Machine-specific Reasonix config (permissions grants, sandbox mirrors, the
# optional OCR plugin) -- never ships. The portable template is
# reasonix.toml.example; copy it if you want local config.
reasonix.toml
# Machine-local Reasonix runtime notes (headless-launch recipe, WSL2 interop,
# prompt-cache findings) -- the home of the "Reasonix runtime notes" content;
# kept out of the external-user-facing AGENTS.md. Never ships.
.reasonix/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# JS test runner installs (ruling 16): the closure is pinned in
# tests/js/package-lock.json; node_modules is reproduced by `npm ci`.
node_modules/

# Rust shell build artifacts (plan 13-02); Cargo.lock stays committed (D-14).
src-tauri/target/

# Synthetic legacy fixtures for the migration tool's reconciliation test
# (plan 01-11) are checked-in test data, not learner evidence -- carve them
# out of the *_attempt_*.md rule above, which would otherwise silently drop
# them from every `git add`.
!fixtures/legacy_attempts/
!fixtures/legacy_attempts/*_attempt_*.md
prototypes/17a/render/

# Unattended run logs (tool output, not product state)
.planning/_ox-logs/

# Plan 16B-09 runtime-materialized per-install state, never committed:
# the bundled sample course's bytes and the first-run/shelf records.
_sample_course/
_ia/

# GSD framework installs written by the client tooling (`.codex/`, and the
# same layout under `.claude/` when installed there): agents, hooks, and the
# gsd-* skill set belong to the tool, not to this project. The project's own
# skills live in `.claude/skills` and `.agents/skills`, which CI keeps
# byte-identical and which stay committed. Machine-local, like reasonix.toml.
.codex/
.claude/get-shit-done/
.claude/agents/
.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks.json
.claude/gsd-file-manifest.json
.claude/gsd-install-state.json
